{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Root-caused the xdist classify collection collision: the engine ships rebar_reconciler/classify.py as a MODULE while tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/classify/ is a PACKAGE of the same dotted name. The conftest shadow bridge APPENDED the shadow dir after the engine dir on rebar_reconciler.__path__, so an engine-first seed (path==[engine_dir]) resolved the name to the engine module -> 'not a package'. Fix: order shadow dir BEFORE engine dir unconditionally + evict stale non-package classify module. Added RED regression test (engine-first seed) tests/unit/test_reconciler_shadow_package_ordering.py. Pushed as Gerrit change 2252 (below 2249 in the stack)."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787797812635730001,"uuid":"0988214f-8c02-4fe5-b65a-5356b7987b10"}